  "implementation": {
    "compiler": "One bounded immutable shared matrix producer, row-major component selectors and explicit per-array Float32/Double input/output casts. Dynamic, wide and rank-deficient actual-raster solve, square inverse and rectangular pseudoinverse. Existing stable literal full-column-rank NumPy rcond=None route retained.",
